{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:2.40.470","page_type":"section"},"citation":"2.40.470","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.470","content_hash":"b8860aba755e251c905cce01813b3f12587424d2c520cd1b5a8c39489842d287","heading":"Municipal Court diversion – Definitions.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.470:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.470","text":"As used in K.S.A. 8-1009 , 12-4413 to 12-4418 , inclusive:\n(a) “City attorney” means a city attorney of a city of this State.\n(b) “Complaint” means complaint, citation or notice to appear in a municipal court.\n(c) “Diversion” means referral of a defendant in a criminal case charging an alcohol-related offense to a supervised performance program prior to adjudication.\n(d) “Diversion agreement” means the specification of formal terms and conditions which a defendant must fulfill in order to have the charges against such person dismissed.\n(e) “Alcohol-related offense” means violation of an ordinance of a city of this State that prohibits the acts prohibited by K.S.A. 8-1567 , and amendments thereto, or violation of such statute. (Ord. 20206 § 9, 9-10-19; Ord. 17666 § 49, 3-27-01. Code 1995 § 50-84. Formerly 2.110.470.)\nState Law References: Similar State statute, K.S.A. 12-4413 .","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"220d9874-6fea-5aba-bf2b-509d55db427c"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"2.40.470","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.470","content_hash":"187c1050f4f286e4b809f0aa178e835d9fe783e1fa14bd02031c18adb0f31688","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.470:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.470:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.470","text":"As used in K.S.A. 8-1009 , 12-4413 to 12-4418 , inclusive:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"2cdebb0b-d329-5413-8b6a-6f5233ba5273"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"2.40.470","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.470","content_hash":"8f99dee58c50d7079c9b09354d0e7f45a8c5a1844f657eba71cd3dff0473d09a","heading":null,"ordinal":1,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.470:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.470:block:1","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.470","text":"(a) “City attorney” means a city attorney of a city of this State.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"1d5e5c8a-d963-50d8-9f58-22893fdcb188"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"2.40.470","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.470","content_hash":"db9d7c044ab9ed67c6067dad5c923e52c60aee05bf23b9fe9463660aa271ace4","heading":null,"ordinal":2,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.470:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.470:block:2","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.470","text":"(b) “Complaint” means complaint, citation or notice to appear in a municipal court.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"6f1a6373-06ce-583a-85ce-1274399a1f5a"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"2.40.470","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.470","content_hash":"f7f48ab4004abb3919898d5124884d8687e844866657bd3fa702b8004793eda1","heading":null,"ordinal":3,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.470:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:t